# Design fixtures and assets must survive checkout byte-for-byte. The PDF fixture is
# largely ASCII, so git otherwise sniffs it as text and rewrites its line endings, which
# breaks the xref byte offsets and the importer test with it.
*.pdf binary
*.psd binary
*.psb binary
*.ai binary
*.riv binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.otf binary
*.ttf binary
